# Gives week 1's book, nothing else (staff: a lost copy, execute as NAME run function ...).
give @s minecraft:written_book[minecraft:written_book_content={title:"The Rope",author:"Mira Salt-Hand",pages:["I am Mira Salt-Hand, last keeper of the knots. Write this down, whoever finds it: the edge of your world is not a wall. It is a rope, and a monkey tied it.","His name was Ruk. He was small, loud and always hungry, and he was king only because nobody else would climb that high. From the top of the tallest tree he saw the Hollow coming.","The Hollow is not dark and not cold. It is unmade: land nobody has dreamed yet. Ruk tied a rope round his people so the Hollow could not take them. Then he sat on it."]},minecraft:lore=[{text:"Page 1 of 11, the Knotkeeper's chronicle",color:"gray",italic:0b}]]
